WEBVTT

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:06.570
Yamashiro, all ships are ready to go.

00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:09.230
Understood, Sister.

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:15.130
1530. This fleet will now proceed through 
the Surigao Strait and into Leyte!

00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:17.790
The 1st Striking Force's main
 fleet has already left.

00:00:17.790 --> 00:00:20.120
We will support their assault on Leyte Gulf

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:23.940
and destruction of 
the enemy invasion force!

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:28.000
1st Striking Force, 3rd Section!
 Weigh anchor!

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:32.380
Battleship Division 2, 
Fusou. Weighing anchor.

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:34.130
Mogami, weighing anchor!

00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:36.140
Shigure, weighing anchor!

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:38.720
Destroyer Division 4! Weighing anchor!

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:41.590
Set a course for the Surigao Strait!

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:58.140
<b>See You Again on Another Quiet Blue Sea</b>

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:24.370
<b>Into the Strait</b>

00:02:34.250 --> 00:02:38.230
<i>Shigure, the enemy... 
the enemy is unstoppable.</i>

00:02:38.680 --> 00:02:42.940
<i>Please protect everyone, 
Yamashiro especially.</i>

00:02:44.280 --> 00:02:47.310
<i>No rain... lasts forever.</i>

00:02:48.940 --> 00:02:49.840
I'm sure...

00:02:49.840 --> 00:02:51.980
Flagship to Mogami.

00:02:51.980 --> 00:02:54.250
You are to launch reconnaissance seaplanes.

00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:56.060
Requesting reconnaissance of the enemy

00:02:56.060 --> 00:02:58.230
in Leyte Gulf as well as those 
on our current course.

00:02:58.650 --> 00:03:00.190
Mogami, roger.

00:03:01.600 --> 00:03:03.610
Preparing to launch recon plane 1!

00:03:10.270 --> 00:03:12.980
Recon plane 1, launch preparations complete!

00:03:19.450 --> 00:03:20.340
I'm counting on you.

00:03:22.770 --> 00:03:24.250
Cleared for takeoff!

00:03:30.260 --> 00:03:31.400
Offering additional plan!

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:35.460
Requesting permission to launch 
the second reconnaissance and guide plane

00:03:35.460 --> 00:03:37.350
in accordance with plan 2.

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:41.030
Very well. Permission granted!

00:03:41.600 --> 00:03:45.110
Now initiating launch 
preparations for Zuiun 2!

00:03:47.100 --> 00:03:48.780
Zuiun 2, take off!

00:04:01.310 --> 00:04:02.410
It's all up to you now.

00:04:53.940 --> 00:04:56.140
Mogami to flagship Yamashiro.

00:04:56.140 --> 00:04:57.520
What is it?

00:04:57.520 --> 00:05:00.650
<i>Incoming information on
 the enemy from Zuiun 1.</i>

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:04.470
<i>At least a dozen enemy PT boat groups 
are stationed within Surigao Strait.</i>

00:05:04.470 --> 00:05:08.150
<i>Multiple PT boats in front 
of the strait, as well!</i>

00:05:08.640 --> 00:05:09.780
An ambush.

00:05:13.910 --> 00:05:16.050
Indeed, Sister.

00:05:17.540 --> 00:05:20.420
Mogami, continue your report.

00:05:20.940 --> 00:05:24.920
Zuiun 1 has an update 
on the enemy's positions.

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:30.430
<i>"I have reached Leyte Gulf and sighted the enemy invasion force!"</i>

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:33.110
"The enemy force in Leyte Gulf 
is as follows: Eighty transport ships!

00:05:33.110 --> 00:05:35.460
Four battleships! Multiple cruisers!

00:05:35.460 --> 00:05:37.430
Multiple destroyers!"

00:05:38.680 --> 00:05:40.560
Good.

00:05:40.560 --> 00:05:42.800
Just like we thought. They're here in force.

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:44.520
Yamashiro?

00:05:45.450 --> 00:05:47.550
Don't worry, Sister.

00:05:47.550 --> 00:05:51.700
We'll start by taking out those annoying 
little imps at the entrance to the strait—

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:54.450
Enemy submarines! 
Periscope spotted at 165 degrees!

00:05:55.280 --> 00:05:56.580
What?

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:01.960
Oh, dear! That's a problem!

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:05.280
All ships, anti-air and anti-submarine 
defenses to maximum alert!

00:06:12.850 --> 00:06:14.610
Incoming enemy aircraft at 20 degrees!

00:06:14.610 --> 00:06:15.840
Enemy formation!

00:06:20.860 --> 00:06:22.050
Yamashiro?

00:06:25.470 --> 00:06:28.520
So the battle's already started, huh?

00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:30.240
Fine, then!

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:32.540
All ships, prepare for anti-air combat!

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:34.740
Stay on alert for enemy submarines!

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:36.210
Mogami!

00:06:36.210 --> 00:06:37.370
Roger!

00:06:38.490 --> 00:06:41.810
Initiating fleet anti-air defense! 
Launching Kyoufuu Kai!

00:06:45.720 --> 00:06:49.710
Now launching 3, and 4!

00:06:50.630 --> 00:06:53.450
Launching Zuiuns as well!

00:06:53.450 --> 00:06:54.890
I'm sending up all I've got!

00:07:07.910 --> 00:07:09.630
Prepare for anti-air combat!

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:13.800
Load Type 3 shells!

00:07:15.940 --> 00:07:17.030
All ready!

00:08:30.880 --> 00:08:32.130
Fire!

00:08:55.820 --> 00:08:57.360
Damn it!

00:09:03.640 --> 00:09:04.910
Fusou!

00:09:04.910 --> 00:09:05.910
Sister!

00:09:06.390 --> 00:09:10.900
I'm fine. I'm not... hurt...

00:09:12.420 --> 00:09:14.150
Damn you all!

00:09:23.100 --> 00:09:23.910
Shigure!

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:26.410
I won't let it end here!

00:09:27.910 --> 00:09:30.570
I said leave us alone!

00:09:37.350 --> 00:09:41.300
At this distance, you want 
to use machine guns!

00:09:41.970 --> 00:09:43.300
Yama-chan, watch out!

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:49.060
I won't let it hurt you!

00:09:56.060 --> 00:09:58.690
Thank you!

00:09:59.100 --> 00:10:00.490
Watch out for collisions!

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:03.100
Wait, no, watch out for bombers!

00:10:03.100 --> 00:10:03.930
Right?

00:10:09.760 --> 00:10:11.210
Enemy aircraft retreating.

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:13.420
Fleet, form up!

00:10:14.080 --> 00:10:15.160
Roger!

00:10:15.160 --> 00:10:16.140
Roger that!

00:10:18.360 --> 00:10:19.850
Good work.

00:10:26.410 --> 00:10:28.640
All ships, damage report!

00:10:30.680 --> 00:10:32.480
Destroyer Division 4 reports no damage.

00:10:32.930 --> 00:10:36.560
Fusou and I have taken light 
damage. I'm fine, but...

00:10:36.560 --> 00:10:38.360
Fusou? You okay?

00:10:38.360 --> 00:10:40.740
I'm fine, Shigure.

00:10:40.740 --> 00:10:42.190
Sister...

00:10:43.230 --> 00:10:46.230
Yamashiro, I'm fine.

00:10:46.230 --> 00:10:49.570
It'd take more than that 
to even scratch a Fusou class!

00:10:50.200 --> 00:10:51.120
I mean it.

00:10:51.120 --> 00:10:53.840
Sister, don't lie to me.

00:10:53.840 --> 00:10:55.520
I'm not.

00:10:55.520 --> 00:10:56.960
Right, Shigure?

00:10:58.460 --> 00:10:59.380
Yeah.

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:03.130
Shigure, you need to
 protect my sister, okay?!

00:11:03.130 --> 00:11:07.150
Yamashiro, Shigure <i>did</i> protect me.

00:11:07.150 --> 00:11:14.570
That goes for us, too... We have to 
protect everyone, as well.

00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:17.010
Fusou.

00:11:18.480 --> 00:11:21.450
To tell the future...

00:11:22.900 --> 00:11:24.410
Sister...

00:11:26.280 --> 00:11:28.940
Okay, are we done talking?

00:11:28.940 --> 00:11:31.700
I'm sending the remaining 
Kyoufuu Kai back to San Jose.

00:11:40.080 --> 00:11:43.160
My Zuiuns weren't badly 
damaged. They can still fight.

00:11:43.610 --> 00:11:46.390
We're entering Surigao at sunset, right?

00:11:46.880 --> 00:11:48.550
But before that...

00:11:48.550 --> 00:11:51.510
We crush those little imps and their ambush.

00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:54.940
Mogami, how are your wounds?

00:11:54.940 --> 00:11:57.760
I'm just fine!

00:11:58.350 --> 00:12:00.870
Now, follow me, Destroyer Division 4!

00:12:00.870 --> 00:12:01.950
Roger.

00:12:02.280 --> 00:12:04.360
Well then, I'm sorry, but...

00:12:04.360 --> 00:12:05.400
I'm counting on you.

00:12:05.400 --> 00:12:06.430
Roger.

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:12.670
Mogami and Destroyer Division 4 
will split off from Section 3

00:12:12.670 --> 00:12:15.160
and advance ahead of the rest of the fleet,

00:12:15.160 --> 00:12:17.830
entering the front of the strait at sunset.

00:12:17.830 --> 00:12:19.820
Your orders are to eliminate 
the enemy PT boats

00:12:19.820 --> 00:12:23.060
and clear the path for Section 3's main fleet.

00:12:23.060 --> 00:12:24.690
W-We'll do it!

00:12:24.690 --> 00:12:29.220
Asa-chan, Yamagumo's here, 
so there's nothing to be afraid of!

00:12:29.220 --> 00:12:33.030
What? I'm worried <i>because </i>you're here!

00:12:33.490 --> 00:12:35.490
Asa-chan!

00:12:35.490 --> 00:12:38.990
Stop it! This is a really important moment!

00:12:38.990 --> 00:12:42.040
You two aren't scared at all?

00:12:42.040 --> 00:12:43.480
Asa-chan!

00:12:43.480 --> 00:12:46.990
Shigure, you're escorting 
us in the main fleet.

00:12:47.680 --> 00:12:50.290
Make sure you protect my sister!

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:51.320
Okay.

00:12:52.430 --> 00:12:54.550
Thank you, Shigure.

00:12:55.140 --> 00:12:56.380
Please look out for us.

00:12:57.650 --> 00:12:58.680
Okay.

00:13:03.690 --> 00:13:07.510
Section 3 advance force, heading out!

00:14:01.070 --> 00:14:04.690
This'll be our last sortie ever, maybe.

00:14:16.660 --> 00:14:18.940
Yeah, that's right! 
I'll be counting on your help!

00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:27.940
Zuiun night battle formation, 
prepare for launch!

00:14:43.740 --> 00:14:46.240
Enemy PT patrol torpedo boats sighted!

00:14:46.240 --> 00:14:47.590
There they are!

00:14:48.240 --> 00:14:51.380
Port side, there's... three, four, five—

00:14:51.380 --> 00:14:52.750
Multiple incoming!

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:56.250
All ships, prepare to fire 
cannons port side!

00:14:56.250 --> 00:14:58.020
Attack the enemy approaching from port—

00:14:58.020 --> 00:14:59.290
From starboard, too!

00:14:59.810 --> 00:15:01.670
Enemy PT boats incoming 
from starboard, too!

00:15:02.290 --> 00:15:04.720
Asagumo, Yamagumo, take starboard!

00:15:04.720 --> 00:15:06.570
Michishio and I will take port!

00:15:06.570 --> 00:15:08.440
You are authorized to fire at will!

00:15:08.440 --> 00:15:09.540
Destroy them!

00:15:09.540 --> 00:15:10.600
Okay!

00:15:19.530 --> 00:15:21.210
One down!

00:16:08.450 --> 00:16:09.490
Yamashiro!

00:16:09.490 --> 00:16:11.830
Shigure, calm down.

00:16:11.830 --> 00:16:15.600
Sister, Mogami's advance force 
has encountered the enemy.

00:16:15.600 --> 00:16:17.250
We will increase our speed.

00:16:17.680 --> 00:16:19.630
Yes, Yamashiro. That's right.

00:16:21.530 --> 00:16:23.730
The advance force has encountered the enemy!

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:26.280
Main fleet, increase speed—

00:16:26.630 --> 00:16:27.760
Yamashiro!

00:16:27.760 --> 00:16:28.960
What?

00:16:29.590 --> 00:16:30.680
That's...

00:16:33.260 --> 00:16:35.570
Yamashiro, PT imps!

00:16:39.520 --> 00:16:41.520
T-They're going to surround us!

00:16:41.520 --> 00:16:42.930
Shigure, increase speed!

00:16:42.930 --> 00:16:44.010
Engage the enemy!

00:16:44.010 --> 00:16:45.410
Initiate combat!

00:16:46.430 --> 00:16:47.780
Shigure, orders received!

00:16:47.780 --> 00:16:49.560
Open fire!

00:16:49.560 --> 00:16:50.410
Sister!

00:16:50.930 --> 00:16:52.800
I hear you loud and clear, Yamashiro.

00:16:52.800 --> 00:16:53.650
Fire!

00:16:58.040 --> 00:17:00.470
The damn things are so fast!

00:17:00.470 --> 00:17:02.760
Shigure, do something!

00:17:02.760 --> 00:17:04.050
I'm trying!

00:17:16.130 --> 00:17:18.180
Torpedoes hit the water! Starboard!

00:17:32.810 --> 00:17:33.450
Fusou!

00:17:35.450 --> 00:17:36.950
Sister! Shigure!

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:51.570
Shigure!

00:18:01.970 --> 00:18:02.770
Got 'em!

00:18:02.770 --> 00:18:03.830
Mogami?!

00:18:06.990 --> 00:18:10.670
Don't get yourselves sunk 
while I'm gone, okay?

00:18:12.990 --> 00:18:14.040
Michishio...

00:18:14.420 --> 00:18:15.480
H-Hmph.

00:18:15.480 --> 00:18:18.660
Just pay me back later, with interest.

00:18:19.910 --> 00:18:21.540
Wait, darn it!

00:18:22.100 --> 00:18:24.470
Time for your punishment!

00:18:31.540 --> 00:18:34.200
Cleanup complete?

00:18:34.200 --> 00:18:35.300
I guess so.

00:18:37.430 --> 00:18:41.290
Yamashiro! I guess we missed a few?

00:18:41.290 --> 00:18:42.430
Sorry!

00:18:43.380 --> 00:18:44.730
"A few"?

00:18:44.730 --> 00:18:47.810
You were supposed to make sure 
the path was <i>completely</i> clear—

00:18:50.350 --> 00:18:52.570
Well, whatever.

00:18:52.570 --> 00:18:55.540
That's right. We're all okay.

00:18:56.390 --> 00:18:58.560
Right, Yamashiro?

00:19:00.110 --> 00:19:01.320
Sister...

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:10.460
Mogami, thank you.

00:19:11.090 --> 00:19:13.210
Hey, watch out for collisions!

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:18.380
That's right.

00:19:20.450 --> 00:19:23.100
Shigure. Thank you.

00:19:25.950 --> 00:19:29.750
Thank you for protecting my sister.

00:19:30.790 --> 00:19:32.610
No, I...

00:19:32.610 --> 00:19:36.430
Shigure, even if we sink...

00:19:37.260 --> 00:19:40.370
No, even if we can't fight anymore...

00:19:46.540 --> 00:19:49.130
No. Never mind.

00:20:40.930 --> 00:20:45.560
<b>Transmission from 1YB3H, to...</b>

00:20:47.470 --> 00:20:48.390
Hmm.

00:20:49.680 --> 00:20:52.960
<b>I will now serve as your guide, over.</b>

00:20:56.190 --> 00:20:57.190
Nachi!

00:20:57.190 --> 00:20:59.700
Indeed! Fleet, increase speed!

00:20:59.700 --> 00:21:01.190
Gotcha!

00:21:02.430 --> 00:21:05.200
2nd Striking Force, full speed ahead!

00:21:49.260 --> 00:21:54.570
1st Striking Force, 3rd Section 
will now advance through the Surigao Strait

00:21:54.570 --> 00:21:56.180
and into Leyte Gulf!

00:22:00.210 --> 00:22:02.770
Fleet, switch to vanguard formation!

00:22:02.770 --> 00:22:05.050
We are entering the Surigao Strait!

00:23:29.050 --> 00:23:30.720
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:34.680 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Night Battle in the Strait</b>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:37.910
Get the hell out of my way!
